{{SCOPE_P1}}
        <p>CoinVault is a personal catalogue for your own collectible coins and notes. It is not an appraiser, a marketplace, or an investment adviser, and nothing it shows is financial or valuation advice.</p>
        <p><strong>Contact note (免责条 / Disclaimer):</strong><br> <em>CoinVault only catalogs the collection you record, on this device. It is not an appraiser and gives no investment advice.</em><br> <span style="color:var(--muted)">CoinVault 只在本机为你所录入的收藏做编目。它不做鉴定，也不提供任何投资建议。</span></p>

{{SCOPE_P1}}
        <p>GiftLoop is a personal list of gift ideas for the people you care about. It is not a store, a marketplace, or a payment processor, and it does not sell or deliver any goods or services.</p>
        <div class="zh"><strong>中文说明：</strong>GiftLoop 只在本机保存你所记录的礼物灵感。它不是商店，也不处理任何付款；开发者不经营服务器，也不会通过本应用接收你录入的礼物信息。</div>

{{SCOPE_P1}}
        <p>SeedVault is a personal inventory of the seeds you own. It is not a seed seller and does not provide planting, legal, or financial advice.</p>
        <p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> SeedVault only stores the seed inventory you enter, on this device. It is not a seed seller and gives no planting advice.</p>

{{SCOPE_P1}}
        <p>StitchLoop is a personal progress log for your own craft, knitting and stitching projects. It only tracks the project totals—such as rows done against a target and an optional finish deadline—that you record on this device. <strong>StitchLoop is not a pattern shop and gives no crafting, knitting or stitching instruction.</strong></p>
        <p class="zh">StitchLoop 只在本机记录你填写的那些手工项目的进度（如已完成行数与目标行数、可选的完成期限）。它不是图样商店，也不提供任何编织/手工教学。</p>
